<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>13 - Menampilkan Video</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h3>Video Lokal</h3>
    <video width="400" controls>
        <source src="video-tutorial.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        Browser Anda tidak mendukung tag video.
    </video>

    <h3>Embed Video YouTube</h3>
    <iframe width="400" height="225" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</body>
</html>